  "title": "Olive Oil Infused Ethiopian Snow Peas Stew",
  "description": "This earthy and crumbly Ethiopian stew features snow peas as the main ingredient, with a low-calorie friendly twist, perfect for a monsoon day. It is a hearty and comforting dish that is sure to warm your belly and your soul.",
