  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the snow peas and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the berbere spice, salt, and black pepper and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the stew for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
